# v101 — Firebase Cloud Messaging service-account credentials.
# Anyone holding this JSON can push notifications to every install
# of the app. It must NEVER enter the repo. The actual file lives
# outside the project on dev machines and is mounted via Render
# Secret File in production.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
serviceAccountKey.json
firebase-service-account*.json

